    {
      "_id": "PyIopDshBVwqzbCH",
      "name": "Aberration",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">Silvanesti's nightmare given shape. These are not creatures so much as the dream's own furniture, and they behave by dream logic: they are real while the party believes them.</p>\n<p><strong>2 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 9&ndash;13 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Arc IV, the Silvanesti expedition.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Aberration/CR09.00_49_Dream_of_the_Fallen.webp\" alt=\"Dream of the Fallen\"><figcaption><strong>Dream of the Fallen</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 9 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 136 hp &middot; Medium aberration</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Aberration/CR13.00_50_Loracs_Remnant.webp\" alt=\"Lorac's Remnant\"><figcaption><strong>Lorac's Remnant</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 13 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 189 hp &middot; Large aberration</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
