      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">The road's ordinary dangers. Nothing here is a plot, and that is the point — it exists to make the journey feel long.</p>\n<p><strong>1 creature</strong> &middot; CR 1&ndash;1 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Arc I, the thirty-nine days.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Beast/CR01.00_73_Forest_Wolf_Pack_Leader.webp\" alt=\"Forest Wolf Pack Leader\"><figcaption><strong>Forest Wolf Pack Leader</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1 &middot; AC 13 &middot; 37 hp &middot; Medium beast</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
