    {
      "_id": "1qJ1VgTeBHPMB94Q",
      "name": "Dragon",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">The largest group in the bestiary, and the war itself. It runs from a Baaz draconian up to the ancients, because on Krynn the draconians are what became of stolen dragon eggs and belong on the same ladder.</p>\n<p><strong>35 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 1&ndash;27 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Draconians from Arc I. Wyrmlings and young from Arc II. Ancients are Arcs V and VI.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR01.00_01_Baaz_Draconian.webp\" alt=\"Baaz Draconian\"><figcaption><strong>Baaz Draconian</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1 &middot; AC 14 &middot; 22 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR02.00_21_Black_Dragon_Wyrmling.webp\" alt=\"Black Dragon, Wyrmling\"><figcaption><strong>Black Dragon, Wyrmling</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 2 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 33 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR02.00_22_Green_Dragon_Wyrmling.webp\" alt=\"Green Dragon, Wyrmling\"><figcaption><strong>Green Dragon, Wyrmling</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 2 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 38 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR02.00_20_White_Dragon_Wyrmling.webp\" alt=\"White Dragon, Wyrmling\"><figcaption><strong>White Dragon, Wyrmling</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 2 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 32 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR03.00_23_Blue_Dragon_Wyrmling.webp\" alt=\"Blue Dragon, Wyrmling\"><figcaption><strong>Blue Dragon, Wyrmling</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 3 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 52 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR03.00_02_Kapak_Draconian.webp\" alt=\"Kapak Draconian\"><figcaption><strong>Kapak Draconian</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 3 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 45 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR04.00_03_Bozak_Draconian.webp\" alt=\"Bozak Draconian\"><figcaption><strong>Bozak Draconian</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 4 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 66 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR04.00_24_Red_Dragon_Wyrmling.webp\" alt=\"Red Dragon, Wyrmling\"><figcaption><strong>Red Dragon, Wyrmling</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 4 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 75 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR06.00_32_Brass_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Brass Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Brass Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 110 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR06.00_04_Sivak_Draconian.webp\" alt=\"Sivak Draconian\"><figcaption><strong>Sivak Draconian</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 102 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR06.00_17_White_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"White Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>White Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 133 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR07.00_16_Black_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Black Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Black Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 7 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 127 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR07.00_34_Copper_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Copper Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Copper Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 7 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 119 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR08.00_33_Bronze_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Bronze Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Bronze Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 8 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 142 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR08.00_15_Green_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Green Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Green Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 8 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 136 hp &middot; Large dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR09.00_05_Aurak_Draconian.webp\" alt=\"Aurak Draconian\"><figcaption><strong>Aurak Draconian</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 9 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 133 hp &middot; Medium dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR09.00_13_Blue_Dragon_Young.webp\" alt=\"Blue Dragon, Young\"><figcaption><strong>Blue Dragon, Young</strong><span class=\"