e dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR15.00_27_Green_Dragon_Adult.webp\" alt=\"Green Dragon, Adult\"><figcaption><strong>Green Dragon, Adult</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 15 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 207 hp &middot; Huge dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR16.00_14_Blue_Dragon_Adult.webp\" alt=\"Blue Dragon, Adult\"><figcaption><strong>Blue Dragon, Adult</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 16 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 225 hp &middot; Huge dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR16.00_35_Silver_Dragon_Adult.webp\" alt=\"Silver Dragon, Adult\"><figcaption><strong>Silver Dragon, Adult</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 16 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 243 hp &middot; Huge dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR17.00_12_Red_Dragon_Adult.webp\" alt=\"Red Dragon, Adult\"><figcaption><strong>Red Dragon, Adult</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 17 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 256 hp &middot; Huge dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR19.00_59_Cyan_Bloodbane.webp\" alt=\"Cyan Bloodbane\"><figcaption><strong>Cyan Bloodbane</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 19 &middot; AC 20 &middot; 287 hp &middot; Gargantuan dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Dragon/CR23.00_28_Blue_Dragon_Ancient.webp\" alt=\"Blue Dragon, Ancient\"><figcaption><strong>Blue Dragon, Ancient</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 23 &middot; AC 22 &middot; 481 hp &middot; Gargantuan dragon</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wa