    {
      "_id": "cbjxMGShcVKTSXdB",
      "name": "Fiend",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">What comes through when the boundary is thin — and, in Arc VI, what is waiting on the other side of it. The Herald speaks for Takhisis and should never be fought before it has been listened to.</p>\n<p><strong>7 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 4&ndash;18 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Arc III in ones and twos. Arc VI in earnest.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR04.00_62_Bound_Abyssal_Lesser.webp\" alt=\"Bound Abyssal Lesser\"><figcaption><strong>Bound Abyssal Lesser</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 4 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 68 hp &middot; Medium fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR05.00_44_Chained_Tormentor.webp\" alt=\"Chained Tormentor\"><figcaption><strong>Chained Tormentor</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 5 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 82 hp &middot; Medium fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR08.00_63_Abyssal_Warbeast.webp\" alt=\"Abyssal Warbeast\"><figcaption><strong>Abyssal Warbeast</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 8 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 133 hp &middot; Large fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR11.00_45_Abyssal_Siegebreaker.webp\" alt=\"Abyssal Siegebreaker\"><figcaption><strong>Abyssal Siegebreaker</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 11 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 189 hp &middot; Huge fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR11.00_64_Nameless_One_of_the_Field.webp\" alt=\"Nameless One of the Field\"><figcaption><strong>Nameless One of the Field</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 11 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 172 hp &middot; Large fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR15.00_46_Warden_of_the_Palace_of_Chains.webp\" alt=\"Warden of the Palace of Chains\"><figcaption><strong>Warden of the Palace of Chains</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 15 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 232 hp &middot; Huge fiend</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Fiend/CR18.00_47_Herald_of_the_Dark_Queen.webp\" alt=\"Herald of the Dark Queen\"><figcaption><strong>Herald of the Dark Queen</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 18 &middot; AC 20 &middot; 297 hp &middot; Huge fiend</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
