      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">Everyone the war is being fought by and over: Dragonarmy soldiers, Solamnic knights, the Conclave, and the people the campaign is actually about. Most of the named stat blocks exist so you know what happens if the party attacks them, not because they are meant to be fought.</p>\n<p><strong>26 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 0&ndash;21 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Throughout.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR00.00_60_Astinus_of_Palanthas.webp\" alt=\"Astinus of Palanthas\"><figcaption><strong>Astinus of Palanthas</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 0 &middot; AC 10 &middot; 30 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR00.25_72_Hill_Brigand.webp\" alt=\"Hill Brigand\"><figcaption><strong>Hill Brigand</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1/4 &middot; AC 13 &middot; 13 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR00.50_06_Dragonarmy_Recruit.webp\" alt=\"Dragonarmy Recruit\"><figcaption><strong>Dragonarmy Recruit</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1/2 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 16 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR00.50_39_Solamnic_Foot_Soldier.webp\" alt=\"Solamnic Foot Soldier\"><figcaption><strong>Solamnic Foot Soldier</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1/2 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 22 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR01.00_43_Aesthetic_of_the_Great_Library.webp\" alt=\"Aesthetic of the Great Library\"><figcaption><strong>Aesthetic of the Great Library</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1 &middot; AC 11 &middot; 27 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR01.00_42_Palanthas_City_Guard.webp\" alt=\"Palanthas City Guard\"><figcaption><strong>Palanthas City Guard</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 1 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 32 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR02.00_41_High_Clerist_Siege_Engineer.webp\" alt=\"High Clerist Siege Engineer\"><figcaption><strong>High Clerist Siege Engineer</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 2 &middot; AC 14 &middot; 39 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR02.00_77_Ossian_Krell.webp\" alt=\"Ossian Krell\"><figcaption><strong>Ossian Krell</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 2 &middot; AC 12 &middot; 38 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR03.00_07_Dragonarmy_Veteran.webp\" alt=\"Dragonarmy Veteran\"><figcaption><strong>Dragonarmy Veteran</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 3 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 58 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR03.00_36_Knight_of_the_Crown.webp\" alt=\"Knight of the Crown\"><figcaption><strong>Knight of the Crown</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 3 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 52 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR04.00_40_Solanthus_Watch_Captain.webp\" alt=\"Solanthus Watch Captain\"><figcaption><strong>Solanthus Watch Captain</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 4 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 71 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR05.00_10_Dragonarmy_Intelligence_Agent.webp\" alt=\"Dragonarmy Intelligence Agent\"><figcaption><strong>Dragonarmy Intelligence Agent</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 5 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 71 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR05.00_74_Lost_Wanderer_of_Wayreth.webp\" alt=\"Lost Wanderer of Wayreth\"><figcaption><strong>Lost Wanderer of Wayreth</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 5 &middot; AC 12 &middot; 66 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR06.00_08_Dragonarmy_Officer.webp\" alt=\"Dragonarmy Officer\"><figcaption><strong>Dragonarmy Officer</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 97 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR06.00_37_Knight_of_the_Sword.webp\" alt=\"Knight of the Sword\"><figcaption><strong>Knight of the Sword</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 97 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR07.00_09_Dragonarmy_Battle_Mage.webp\" alt=\"Dragonarmy Battle Mage\"><figcaption><strong>Dragonarmy Battle Mage</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 7 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 82 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR08.00_75_Commander_Veyrath.webp\" alt=\"Commander Veyrath\"><figcaption><strong>Commander Veyrath</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 8 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 112 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR08.00_55_Dalamar_Argent.webp\" alt=\"Dalamar Argent\"><figcaption><strong>Dalamar Argent</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 8 &middot; AC 14 &middot; 78 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR09.00_76_Mereth_Sorn_Renegade.webp\" alt=\"Mereth Sorn, Renegade\"><figcaption><strong>Mereth Sorn, Renegade</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 9 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 95 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR09.00_70_Renegade_Hunter.webp\" alt=\"Renegade Hunter\"><figcaption><strong>Renegade Hunter</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 9 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 91 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR10.00_38_Knight_of_the_Rose.webp\" alt=\"Knight of the Rose\"><figcaption><strong>Knight of the Rose</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 10 &middot; AC 20 &middot; 157 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR12.00_57_Kitiara_uth_Matar.webp\" alt=\"Kitiara uth Matar\"><figcaption><strong>Kitiara uth Matar</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 12 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 161 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR13.00_54_Justarius_of_the_Red_Robes.webp\" alt=\"Justarius of the Red Robes\"><figcaption><strong>Justarius of the Red Robes</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 13 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 110 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR14.00_53_Ladonna_of_the_Black_Robes.webp\" alt=\"Ladonna of the Black Robes\"><figcaption><strong>Ladonna of the Black Robes</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 14 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 120 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR15.00_52_Par_Salian_of_the_White_Robes.webp\" alt=\"Par-Salian of the White Robes\"><figcaption><strong>Par-Salian of the White Robes</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 15 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 135 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Humanoid/CR21.00_51_Raistlin_Majere_Master_of_Wayreth.webp\" alt=\"Raistlin Majere, Master of Wayreth\"><figcaption><strong>Raistlin Majere, Master of Wayreth</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 21 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 190 hp &middot; Medium humanoid</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
