    {
      "_id": "bbK6dYBdarxnzm51",
      "name": "Plant",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">Wayreth's forest and Silvanesti's. Both are aware, neither is friendly, and neither can be reasoned with by anything the party is carrying.</p>\n<p><strong>2 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 6&ndash;7 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Arc I at the forest edge; Arc IV in the dream.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Plant/CR06.00_48_Nightmare_Tree.webp\" alt=\"Nightmare Tree\"><figcaption><strong>Nightmare Tree</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 15 &middot; 114 hp &middot; Huge plant</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Plant/CR07.00_71_Shoikan_Grove_Sentinel.webp\" alt=\"Shoikan Grove Sentinel\"><figcaption><strong>Shoikan Grove Sentinel</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 7 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 115 hp &middot; Huge plant</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
