      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"wayreth-journal\">\n<p class=\"wy-lead\">Dargaard's dead, the Returned, and the things in the vaults that did not stay where they were put.</p>\n<p><strong>8 creatures</strong> &middot; CR 4&ndash;22 &middot; <strong>When:</strong> Arc III onward; the Returned define Arc V.</p>\n<p>Every one of these is a real Actor in <strong>Wayreth — Bestiary</strong>. Drag it onto a scene and it arrives with this art, a token scaled to its size, and its attacks ready to roll.</p>\n<div class=\"wy-gallery\"><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR04.00_67_The_Returned.webp\" alt=\"The Returned\"><figcaption><strong>The Returned</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 4 &middot; AC 16 &middot; 65 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR05.00_65_Skeletal_Knight_of_Dargaard.webp\" alt=\"Skeletal Knight of Dargaard\"><figcaption><strong>Skeletal Knight of Dargaard</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 5 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 84 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR06.00_66_Banshee_of_the_Keep.webp\" alt=\"Banshee of the Keep\"><figcaption><strong>Banshee of the Keep</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 6 &middot; AC 14 &middot; 78 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR09.00_68_Vault_Experiment.webp\" alt=\"Vault Experiment\"><figcaption><strong>Vault Experiment</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 9 &middot; AC 17 &middot; 138 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR12.00_78_Caramon_Majere_Returned.webp\" alt=\"Caramon Majere, Returned\"><figcaption><strong>Caramon Majere, Returned</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 12 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 187 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR12.00_69_Guardian_of_the_Tower.webp\" alt=\"Guardian of the Tower\"><figcaption><strong>Guardian of the Tower</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 12 &middot; AC 18 &middot; 149 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR20.00_58_Fistandantilus.webp\" alt=\"Fistandantilus\"><figcaption><strong>Fistandantilus</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 20 &middot; AC 19 &middot; 225 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"wy-plate\"><img src=\"modules/wayreth-black-master/assets/bestiary/Undead/CR22.00_56_Lord_Soth_Knight_of_the_Black_Rose.webp\" alt=\"Lord Soth, Knight of the Black Rose\"><figcaption><strong>Lord Soth, Knight of the Black Rose</strong><span class=\"wy-plate-stats\">CR 22 &middot; AC 20 &middot; 279 hp &middot; Medium undead</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>"
